* C: CMOS two-stage op amp with a p-MOS input pair, +/-2.5 V
.subckt OPA_PMOS inp inn vcc vee out
* tail: pmos current source 20 uA from vcc
Mb  b b vcc vcc PM W=20u L=2u
Ib  b vee 20u
M10 t b vcc vcc PM W=20u L=2u
* input pair (inn on M1, inp on M2) with nmos mirror load
M1 d1 inn t t PM W=40u L=1u
M2 d2 inp t t PM W=40u L=1u
M3 d1 d1 vee vee NM W=10u L=2u
M4 d2 d1 vee vee NM W=10u L=2u
* second stage: nmos common source, pmos current-source load, Miller capacitor
M5 out d2 vee vee NM W=40u L=1u
M6 out b vcc vcc PM W=100u L=2u
Cc d2 out 3p
.ends
